        "combo2": {
            "title": "Simoon and Sudri Double Summon into Bystial Dis Pater",
            "description": "A Black Whirlwind opening that converts Simoon the Poison Wind and Sudri the Phantom Glimmer into two Normal Summons in the same turn. Simoon banishes Harmattan the Dust from hand to summon itself, Whirlwind searches off every summon, and Shamal the Sandstorm banishes itself to bring out Vata the Emblem of Wandering, which mills Chinook the Snow Blast and Zephyros the Elite for Black-Winged Dragon. Zephyros bounces Sudri back to hand to reuse it, Black-Winged Dragon is recycled into Bystial Dis Pater, and Black Feather Whirlwind revives Zephyros and Sharnga the Waning Moon to Synchro Summon Blackwing - Nothung the Starlight. The board finishes with Dis Pater, Nothung, a re-summoned Sudri and Blackwing - Twin Shadow active in the backrow.",
            "credits": "✨ Replay by Blackwinger ✨",
            "date": "August 17, 2026",
